  "description": "GeoPix is a multi-modal large language model (MLLM) for remote sensing that extends image understanding capabilities to the pixel level, supporting image-, region-, and pixel-level tasks such as image captioning, visual question answering, visual grounding, and multi-referring segmentation. It introduces a class-wise learnable memory module and is trained with a two-stage strategy on the large-scale GeoPixInstruct dataset.",
